  "checked_source_contracts": {
    "fuel_and_phase": "Semi is appended enum2. Only Sequential uses720 degree span, one fuel opening/cycle and required cam phase. Semi uses360 degree end-scheduled pairs by firing order modulo360 and two half-effective-mass openings with one deadtime each. No silent trims: configuration and active demand reject nonsequential trims.",
    "full_pulse_or_skip": "End-scheduled start planning retains a committed full-width start if an update is unreachable, otherwise skips an initial firing rather than shortening it. Once an injector opens its low deadline is held. Selective DFCO cancels future fuel starts while preserving an active bounded low; faults use common all-low.",
    "fences": "Mode change is an angle configuration change. Independent test cuts actual charged outputs and rejects an old Candidate by generation/epoch. Existing latched CamPhase survives running Sequential\u2192Semi and clears only after stopped/quiet supervised recovery, as independently recompiled current native test checks.",
    "limits": "Independent exact/nextafter duty85percent and15ms checks pass. Fresh toothRPM re-evaluates interval capacity; a previously acceptable8ms command at1000RPM rejects when planned at8000RPM. Injector/coil masks and hardware drivers remain separate and bounded.",
    "radio_and_migration_source": "Current schema2 support is peer-specific and checks strategy plus current/last timing enum. Schema1 remains0/1 and0..16; schema2 supports2 and17. Unsupported engine observations route to sensors. Receiver enforces negotiated schema; capability equality includes schema. Schema4 upgrade preserves idle/trims and only advances private schema; older migrations retain their idle-off policy. Full radio/MSQ/UI test suites were not independently rerun in this pass.",
    "native_owner_wrapper": "OurController carries target_dispatcher and a1ms worker progression independently of control cadence. run_target_scenarios TargetController delegates to the common implementation. Existing no-edge timer marker is skipped. Speeduino semi profile is explicitly read back after production setup."
